---
interface Props {
  kind: 'editor' | 'terminal' | 'repository' | 'components' | 'schema' | 'collections' | 'media' | 'local' | 'published';
  alt: string;
  caption?: string;
  variant?: 'hero' | 'feature';
}

const { kind, alt, caption, variant = 'feature' } = Astro.props;
const interactiveKinds = new Set(['editor', 'components', 'schema', 'collections', 'media']);
const isInteractive = variant === 'feature' && interactiveKinds.has(kind);
---

<figure class:list={['feature-visual', `feature-visual-${kind}`]} role={isInteractive ? 'group' : 'img'} aria-label={alt} data-interactive={isInteractive ? 'true' : undefined} data-home-reveal="true">
  <div class="fv-surface">
    {kind === 'editor' && (
      <div class:list={['product-window', 'editor-app-window', { 'editor-hero-window': variant === 'hero', 'editor-feature-window': variant === 'feature' }]}>
        <header class="editor-app-bar">
          <div class="editor-app-crumbs">
            <span class="editor-app-back" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="m10 3.5-4.5 4.5 4.5 4.5" /></svg>
            </span>
            <span>Posts</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <strong>One schema to rule the editor</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="editor-app-actions">
            <button type="button" class="editor-app-panel" aria-label="Toggle frontmatter panel">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><rect x="2.5" y="2.5" width="11" height="11" rx="1.5" /><path d="M9.5 2.5v11" /></svg>
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="editor-app-save" data-editor-saved={variant === 'feature' ? '' : undefined}>Save</button>
          </div>
        </header>
        <div class="editor-app-stage">
          <article class="editor-document" data-editor-canvas={variant === 'feature' ? 'true' : undefined} tabindex={variant === 'feature' ? 0 : undefined}>
            <input class="editor-title" value="One schema to rule the editor" readonly={variant === 'hero'} aria-label="Document title" data-editor-title={variant === 'feature' ? '' : undefined} />
            <p class="editor-document-lede">Your Astro content collections already describe your content perfectly. Here's how we generate the entire editing UI from them - validation, fields, docs and all.</p>
            <p>Every Astro site with content collections already has a complete, type-safe description of its content. The Zod schemas in <code>src/content/config.ts</code> define every field, every type, every validation rule. So why do most editors make you describe it all over again?</p>
            <p>Chirp doesn't. It reads your content collection schemas directly and generates the editing experience from them. One schema. One source of truth. No duplication.</p>
            <h3>Reading Astro schemas at runtime</h3>
            <p>The trick is that Zod schemas carry their shape even after compilation. A Zod <code>z.object(&#123; title: z.string(), date: z.date() &#125;)</code> knows it has a <code>title</code> string field and a <code>date</code> date field. Chirp's schema parser walks the Zod AST and extracts:</p>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Field names and types.</strong> String, number, date, boolean, enum, array, object - mapped directly to the appropriate form control.</li>
            </ul>
            {variant === 'feature' && <div class="editor-blocks" data-editor-blocks aria-live="polite"></div>}
          </article>
        </div>
        <footer class="editor-app-status">
          <span data-editor-diff={variant === 'feature' ? '' : undefined}>401 words · ~2 min read</span>
          <span class="editor-app-status-actions">
            {variant === 'feature' ? (
              <button class="editor-block-button" type="button" data-editor-hint aria-expanded="false"><kbd>/</kbd> blocks</button>
            ) : (
              <span><kbd>/</kbd> blocks</span>
            )}
            <span><kbd>⌘S</kbd> save</span>
          </span>
        </footer>
        {variant === 'feature' && (
          <div class="slash-menu editor-app-slash" data-slash-menu role="listbox" aria-label="Insert an mdx component" hidden>
            <div class="slash-head">mdx components added as placeholders</div>
            <div class="slash-item is-selected" data-block-tag="CtaPair" role="option" tabindex="-1"><span>&lt;/&gt;</span> <small>CtaPair.astro</small></div>
            <div class="slash-item" data-block-tag="Card" role="option" tabindex="-1"><span>&lt;/&gt;</span> Card <small>Card.astro · inline</small></div>
            <div class="slash-item" data-block-tag="Image" role="option" tabindex="-1"><span>&lt;/&gt;</span> Image <small>Image.astro · block</small></div>
            <div class="slash-item" data-block-tag="Hero" role="option" tabindex="-1"><span>&lt;/&gt;</span> Hero <small>Hero.astro · block</small></div>
          </div>
        )}
      </div>
    )}

    {kind === 'terminal' && (
      <div class="terminal-window">
        <div class="terminal-bar"><span class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>chirp-site - zsh</div>
        <pre data-terminal-output><span class="terminal-prompt">~</span> pnpm astro add chirp
<span class="terminal-ok">✓</span> added chirp@1.0.0 to devDependencies

<span class="terminal-prompt">~</span> pnpm dev
<span class="terminal-ok">chirp</span>  reading src/content.config.ts
<span class="terminal-ok">chirp</span>  3 collections · 5 entries
<span class="terminal-ready">chirp  ready → http://localhost:4321</span><span class="terminal-caret" aria-hidden="true"></span></pre>
      </div>
    )}

    {kind === 'repository' && (
      <div class="code-window repository-code">
        <div class="code-window-head">your repository · <em>before + after</em></div>
        <pre><span>src/</span>
  <span>content/</span>
    <span>pages/</span>
      <mark>home.mdx ← open above</mark>
      backstory.mdx
    <span>posts/</span>
      public-release.md
      local-by-design.md
    <span>changelog/</span>
      plugins-foundation.md
  content.config.ts
  <span>components/</span>
    Card.astro
    CtaPair.astro
    Hero.astro
    Image.astro
astro.config.mjs</pre>
      </div>
    )}

    {kind === 'components' && (
      <div class="component-demo">
        <div class="code-window component-code">
          <div class="code-window-head">src/components/CtaPair.astro · <em>yours, unchanged</em></div>
          <pre><span>---</span>
<span class="code-keyword">const</span> &#123; primary = <mark>"Get started"</mark>,
        secondary &#125; = Astro.props;
<span>---</span>
<span>&lt;</span><b>div</b> class=<mark>"cta-pair"</mark><span>&gt;</span>
  <span>&lt;</span><b>a</b> class=<mark>"console"</mark> href=<mark>"#get"</mark><span>&gt;</span>&#123;primary&#125;<span>&lt;/</span><b>a</b><span>&gt;</span>
  &#123;secondary &amp;&amp; ...&#125;
<span>&lt;/</span><b>div</b><span>&gt;</span></pre>
        </div>
        <div class="inspector-card">
          <div class="inspector-head">CtaPair.astro</div>
          <div class="inspector-body">
            <label>primary <strong data-component-prop="primary" contenteditable="true" role="textbox" aria-label="Primary CTA label" spellcheck="false" data-render-primary>Get started</strong></label>
            <label>secondary <strong data-component-prop="secondary" contenteditable="true" role="textbox" aria-label="Secondary CTA label" spellcheck="false" data-render-secondary>See how it works</strong></label>
            <label>on your site <div class="rendered-cta"><span>CtaPair · rendered</span><div><b data-render-primary>Get started</b><i data-render-secondary>See how it works</i></div></div></label>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-window component-terminal">
          <div class="terminal-bar"><span class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>●</span> written back to home.mdx - clean mdx, your component</div>
          <pre>writes changes back to the same files.

<span class="terminal-muted">&lt;</span><b>CtaPair</b>
  primary=<mark>"<span data-mdx-primary>Get started</span>"</mark>
  secondary=<mark>"<span data-mdx-secondary>See how it works</span>"</mark> <span class="terminal-muted">/&gt;</span></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    )}

    {kind === 'schema' && (
      <div class="schema-demo">
        <div class="code-window schema-code-window">
          <div class="code-window-head">src/content.config.ts · <em>the one and only schema</em></div>
          <pre data-schema-code-default>schema: z.object(&#123; <span class="code-comment">// every control inferred from its type</span>
  title: z.string(),
  category: reference(<mark>'post_category'</mark>),
  tags: z.array(z.string()),
  related: z.array(reference(<mark>'post'</mark>)),
  price: z.number().optional(),
  draft: z.boolean().default(<b>false</b>),
&#125;)</pre>
          <pre data-schema-code-refined hidden>schema: z.object(&#123; <span class="code-comment">// .describe() layers on the refinements</span>
  title: z.string().describe(<mark>'ui-attrs:title'</mark>),
  category: reference(<mark>'post_category'</mark>).describe(<mark>'radio + search'</mark>),
  tags: z.array(z.string()).describe(<mark>'ui-attrs:&#123;"control":"tags"&#125;'</mark>),
  related: z.array(reference(<mark>'post'</mark>)),
  price: z.number().optional().describe(<mark>'usd'</mark>),
  draft: z.boolean().default(<b>false</b>).describe(<mark>'toggle'</mark>),
&#125;)</pre>
        </div>
        <div class="inspector-card schema-form">
          <div class="inspector-head">changelog/plugins-foundation.md · <em>the same schema, as a form</em><em>try it</em></div>
          <div class="inspector-body">
            <div class="describe-toggle" data-schema-toggle role="button" tabindex="0" aria-pressed="false"><strong>.describe()</strong><i></i><small data-schema-toggle-note>fields as the types infer them - describe your intent to refine</small></div>
            <label>Title <strong>A draft in progress</strong></label>
            <label>Category <span class="schema-field-state" data-schema-default><input class="schema-text-input" data-schema-category value="release-notes" maxlength="24" aria-label="Category" /></span><span class="schema-field-state" data-schema-refined hidden><span class="schema-category-options"><i data-schema-category-option="release-notes" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-selected="true">release-notes</i><i data-schema-category-option="editor" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-selected="false">editor</i><i data-schema-category-option="local-first" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-selected="false">local-first</i><i data-schema-category-option="community" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-selected="false">community</i></span></span></label>
            <label>Tags <span class="schema-field-state" data-schema-default><input class="schema-text-input" data-schema-tags-input value="plugins preview" aria-label="Tags" /></span><span class="schema-field-state" data-schema-refined hidden><textarea class="schema-text-input" data-schema-tags-input aria-label="Tags">plugins preview</textarea></span></label>
            <label>Related <span class="schema-field-state" data-schema-default><input class="schema-text-input" data-schema-related-input value="local-by-design, editor-canvas" aria-label="Related posts" /></span><span class="schema-field-state" data-schema-refined hidden><span class="schema-related-select">Search and select related posts <i>▾</i></span><span class="tag-row schema-related-picker"><i data-schema-related="local-by-design" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-pressed="true">local-by-design ×</i><i data-schema-related="editor-canvas" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-pressed="true">editor-canvas ×</i></span><small>Reference arrays store collection ids.</small></span></label>
            <label>Price <span class="schema-field-state" data-schema-default><strong>0</strong></span><span class="schema-field-state" data-schema-refined hidden><strong class="schema-price"><span>$</span><input type="number" placeholder="0.00" aria-label="Price" /></strong></span></label>
            <label>Draft <span class="schema-field-state" data-schema-default><input class="schema-draft-input" data-schema-draft-input value="true" aria-label="Draft" /></span><span class="schema-field-state" data-schema-refined hidden><strong class="toggle" data-schema-draft-toggle role="button" tabindex="0" aria-pressed="true"><i></i></strong></span></label>
            <pre class="frontmatter-preview" data-schema-preview>title: <mark>"A draft in progress"</mark>
category: <mark>release-notes</mark>
tags: [<mark>plugins</mark>, <mark>preview</mark>]
related: [<mark>local-by-design</mark>, <mark>editor-canvas</mark>]
price: <b>0</b>
draft: <b>true</b></pre>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    )}

    {kind === 'collections' && (
      <div class="collections-window collections-app product-window">
        <header class="collections-app-head">
          <div>
            <h3>Posts</h3>
            <p>5 items · sorted by Newest</p>
          </div>
          <div class="collections-app-head-actions">
            <button type="button" class="collections-control">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M2.5 5h4v4h-4zM9.5 5h4v4h-4zM6 9.5h4v4H6z" /></svg>
              Taxonomies
            </button>
            <span class="collections-new-split">
              <button type="button"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10" /></svg>New Post</button>
              <button type="button" aria-label="More new post options"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="m3 4.5 3 3 3-3" /></svg></button>
            </span>
          </div>
        </header>
        <div class="collections-app-toolbar">
          <div>
            <button type="button" class="collections-control" data-collection-status aria-label="Filter posts">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M2.5 4h11l-4 4.5V12l-3 1.5V8.5z" /></svg>
              Filter
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="collections-control">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 4.5h10M3 8h10M3 11.5h6" /></svg>
              Columns
            </button>
          </div>
          <div>
            <button type="button" class="collections-control"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 3.5v9m0-9L5 6.5M8 3.5l3 3" /></svg>Sort</button>
            <span class="collections-view-toggle" aria-label="View">
              <button type="button" class="is-selected" aria-label="Table view"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 4.5h10M3 8h10M3 11.5h10" /></svg></button>
              <button type="button" aria-label="Card view"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><rect x="2.5" y="2.5" width="4.5" height="4.5" rx="1" /><rect x="9" y="2.5" width="4.5" height="4.5" rx="1" /><rect x="2.5" y="9" width="4.5" height="4.5" rx="1" /><rect x="9" y="9" width="4.5" height="4.5" rx="1" /></svg></button>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="table-scroll collections-table-card"><table><thead><tr><th><span class="collections-checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span></th><th>Title</th><th>Description</th><th>Date</th><th>Category</th><th>Author</th><th>Tags</th></tr></thead><tbody>
          <tr data-category="engineering"><td><span class="collections-checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span></td><td><b data-collection-title>One schema to rule the editor</b></td><td>Your Astro content collections already describe your content…</td><td>Jul 2</td><td><i class="category-pill category-engineering"><span></span>engineering</i></td><td>Chirp Team</td><td>astro, content-collections, schema +1</td></tr>
          <tr data-category="philosophy"><td><span class="collections-checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span></td><td><b>Never Ask Twice: the rule behind every Chirp decision</b></td><td>The principle behind every Chirp decision: the best…</td><td>Jun 24</td><td><i class="category-pill category-philosophy"><span></span>philosophy</i></td><td>Chirp Team</td><td>philosophy, ux, editor +1</td></tr>
          <tr data-category="product"><td><span class="collections-checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span></td><td><b>Why the editor is a dev dependency</b></td><td>Visitors should never pay for the editing experience…</td><td>Jun 17</td><td><i class="category-pill category-product"><span></span>product</i></td><td>Chirp Team</td><td>architecture, performance, editor +1</td></tr>
          <tr data-category="philosophy"><td><span class="collections-checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span></td><td><b>Software should justify its complexity</b></td><td>Every dependency has to earn its place. Our framework…</td><td>May 14</td><td><i class="category-pill category-philosophy"><span></span>philosophy</i></td><td>Chirp Team</td><td>philosophy, architecture, dependencies +1</td></tr>
          <tr data-category="product"><td><span class="collections-checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span></td><td><b>From script to platform</b></td><td>Chirp started as a Node scaffolding script. The first…</td><td>May 6</td><td><i class="category-pill category-product"><span></span>product</i></td><td>Chirp Team</td><td>origin-story, architecture, evolution</td></tr>
        </tbody></table><footer>Showing 1–5 of 5 posts</footer></div>
        <button type="button" class="collections-command"><kbd>⌘K</kbd><strong>Command</strong></button>
      </div>
    )}

    {kind === 'media' && (
      <div class="media-story">
        <div class="media-window product-window">
          <div class="window-bar"><span>chirp · media · src/images</span><span class="window-meta"><span class="live-dot">Local disk</span></span></div>
          <div class="collection-tools"><span data-media-search role="textbox" aria-label="Search media" contenteditable="true" spellcheck="false" tabindex="0">⌕ Search media…</span></div>
          <div class="media-layout">
            <div class="media-grid" data-media-grid>
              <div class="media-tile is-selected"><div class="media-tile-art"><svg viewBox="0 0 400 300"><rect width="400" height="300" fill="var(--surface)"/><rect x="50" y="55" width="300" height="195" rx="10" fill="#fbf9f2" stroke="#c9c2ad"/><rect x="50" y="55" width="300" height="26" rx="10" fill="#fff"/><circle cx="68" cy="68" r="4" fill="#c9c2ad"/><circle cx="82" cy="68" r="4" fill="#c9c2ad"/><rect x="75" y="105" width="180" height="10" rx="5" fill="#3a352a"/><rect x="75" y="130" width="220" height="6" rx="3" fill="#b6ae9a"/><rect x="75" y="146" width="200" height="6" rx="3" fill="#b6ae9a"/><rect x="75" y="176" width="90" height="18" rx="9" fill="#242019"/><rect x="175" y="176" width="80" height="18" rx="9" fill="none" stroke="#b6ae9a"/></svg></div><div class="media-tile-meta"><b>editor-canvas.png</b><small>2400 × 1600 · 812 KB</small></div></div>
              <div class="media-tile"><div class="media-tile-art"><svg viewBox="0 0 400 300"><rect width="400" height="300" fill="#f2ecdc"/><path d="M150 190c22-11 33-29 37-51 3-18 15-37 33-37 15 0 22 12 20 25 24-3 44 3 57 16-19 2-34 8-46 19-13 17-37 35-69 35-13 0-26-3-32-7Z" fill="#221e17"/><circle cx="219" cy="121" r="4" fill="#f2ecdc"/><path d="M272 135l22-10-16 17" fill="#dd4c22"/></svg></div><div class="media-tile-meta"><b>chirp-mark.svg</b><small>vector · 6 KB</small></div></div>
              <div class="media-tile"><div class="media-tile-art"><svg viewBox="0 0 400 300"><rect width="400" height="300" fill="var(--surface)"/><rect x="60" y="70" width="280" height="14" rx="7" fill="#2a261e"/><rect x="60" y="110" width="240" height="10" rx="5" fill="#b6ae9a"/><rect x="60" y="140" width="260" height="10" rx="5" fill="#dd4c22"/><rect x="60" y="170" width="230" height="10" rx="5" fill="#b6ae9a"/><rect x="60" y="200" width="250" height="10" rx="5" fill="#b6ae9a"/></svg></div><div class="media-tile-meta"><b>collections-table.png</b><small>2000 × 1333 · 724 KB</small></div></div>
              <div class="media-tile"><div class="media-tile-art"><svg viewBox="0 0 400 300"><rect width="400" height="300" fill="#f2ecdc"/><rect x="90" y="60" width="100" height="80" rx="8" fill="#2a261e"/><rect x="210" y="60" width="100" height="80" rx="8" fill="#dd4c22"/><rect x="90" y="160" width="100" height="80" rx="8" fill="none" stroke="#2a261e" stroke-width="5"/><rect x="210" y="160" width="100" height="80" rx="8" fill="#b6ae9a"/></svg></div><div class="media-tile-meta"><b>media-grid.png</b><small>1600 × 1600 · 388 KB</small></div></div>
              <div class="media-tile"><div class="media-tile-art"><svg viewBox="0 0 400 300"><rect width="400" height="300" fill="#242019"/><path d="M160 175c16-8 24-21 27-37 2-13 11-27 24-27 11 0 16 9 15 18 17-2 32 2 41 12-14 1-25 6-33 14-10 12-27 25-50 25-9 0-19-2-24-5Z" fill="#f5f2e9"/><path d="M249 118l18-8-13 13" fill="#dd4c22"/><rect x="120" y="215" width="160" height="9" rx="4.5" fill="#453e30"/><rect x="155" y="236" width="90" height="7" rx="3.5" fill="#453e30"/></svg></div><div class="media-tile-meta"><b>og-cover.png</b><small>1200 × 630 · 296 KB</small></div></div>
              <div class="media-tile"><div class="media-tile-art"><svg viewBox="0 0 400 300"><rect width="400" height="300" fill="var(--surface)"/><circle cx="286" cy="90" r="40" fill="#dd4c22"/><path d="M0 300 L120 110 L230 300 Z" fill="#2a261e"/><path d="M170 300 L300 80 L420 300 Z" fill="#221e17"/></svg></div><div class="media-tile-meta"><b>backstory-hero.jpg</b><small>2000 × 1250 · 640 KB</small></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="media-preview"><div class="media-preview-art" data-media-preview-art><svg viewBox="0 0 400 250"><rect width="400" height="250" fill="var(--surface)"/><rect x="50" y="45" width="300" height="160" rx="10" fill="#fbf9f2" stroke="#c9c2ad"/><rect x="50" y="45" width="300" height="25" rx="10" fill="#fff"/><circle cx="68" cy="58" r="4" fill="#c9c2ad"/><circle cx="82" cy="58" r="4" fill="#c9c2ad"/><rect x="75" y="95" width="180" height="10" rx="5" fill="#3a352a"/><rect x="75" y="120" width="220" height="6" rx="3" fill="#b6ae9a"/><rect x="75" y="136" width="200" height="6" rx="3" fill="#b6ae9a"/><rect x="75" y="166" width="90" height="18" rx="9" fill="#242019"/></svg></div><b data-media-preview-name>editor-canvas.png</b><dl><dt>file</dt><dd data-media-preview-path>src/images/editor-canvas.png</dd><dt>size</dt><dd data-media-preview-size>2400 × 1600 · 812 KB</dd></dl><small data-media-preview-hint>Stored on disk. No uploads, no transforms, no CDN.</small><button type="button" data-media-insert>Insert into home.mdx</button><button type="button" class="secondary" data-media-reveal>Reveal in Finder</button></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="media-post product-window"><div class="window-bar"><span>home.mdx - editing</span><span class="window-meta live-dot" data-media-post-status>saved</span></div><div class="media-post-body"><p>Chirp adds a visual markdown and mdx editor to the project you already have. It runs locally, reads your existing content collections, and writes changes back to the same files.</p><div class="media-post-line" data-media-post-line>![editor-canvas](src/images/editor-canvas.png)</div><div class="media-post-image" data-media-post-image><svg viewBox="0 0 400 250"><rect width="400" height="250" fill="var(--surface)"/><rect x="50" y="45" width="300" height="160" rx="10" fill="#fbf9f2" stroke="#c9c2ad"/><rect x="50" y="45" width="300" height="25" rx="10" fill="#fff"/><circle cx="68" cy="58" r="4" fill="#c9c2ad"/><circle cx="82" cy="58" r="4" fill="#c9c2ad"/><rect x="75" y="95" width="180" height="10" rx="5" fill="#3a352a"/><rect x="75" y="120" width="220" height="6" rx="3" fill="#b6ae9a"/><rect x="75" y="136" width="200" height="6" rx="3" fill="#b6ae9a"/><rect x="75" y="166" width="90" height="18" rx="9" fill="#242019"/></svg></div><p class="media-post-cursor">▏</p></div></div>
      </div>
    )}

    {kind === 'local' && (
      <div class="local-demo">
        <div>
          <div class="network-card">
            <div class="code-window-head">network panel · while editing</div>
